<para><computeroutput>global $bearsamppLang</computeroutput></para>
<para>Constructs the download link for a new version if available.</para>

<para>This function compares the current application version with the latest available version. If the latest version is greater, it sets the display flag to true and constructs an HTML link for downloading the new version, appending it to the &apos;download&apos; key in the result array.</para>

